   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Match each equation with a verbal description that represents the same function.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=2x+4\">f(x)=2x+4</span></li>\n</ol>",
